{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Dragon Ball Super: Beerus","Several years have passed since the fierce battle against Majin Buu, and Earth has finally regained a brief moment of peace. At the same time, Beerus, the God of Destruction, awakens from his long, deep sleep.\n\nEven Kai and Supreme Kai, aware of Beerus's overwhelming power to destroy entire planets, watch his awakening with great fear… Meanwhile, Beerus hears rumors of a Saiyan who defeated Frieza—and suddenly appears before Goku.\n\nTargeted by Beerus, the strongest being in the universe, Earth is in grave danger. Thus begins an earth-shattering cosmic battle between the God of Destruction and Goku and his alliesa—a conflict that will shake the entire universe.\n\n\n\n(Source: Official Site)\n\n\n\nNote: “Enhanced” edition of Dragon Ball Super, featuring a large volume of newly added and redrawn cuts, a reconstructed narrative, and updated visuals for a more immersive and faithful representation of Akira Toriyama’s original manga."],"ja":["ドラゴンボール超 ビルス",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":813,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":22777,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":56894,"relation":"prequel"}],"id":"mal-63367","ids":{"shikimori":63367,"mal":63367,"anilist":206814,"kodik":"serial-78931"},"kodikIds":["serial-78921","serial-78945","serial-79067","serial-78931"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-78921":"2026-11-08T20:29:06Z","serial-78945":"2026-11-02T15:24:14Z","serial-79067":"2026-11-02T06:44:41Z","serial-78931":"2026-11-08T20:45:41Z"},"title":"Драконий жемчуг: Супер — Бирус","originalTitle":"Dragon Ball Super: Beerus","alt":"ドラゴンボール超 ビルス Dragon Ball Super: Beerus ドラゴンボール超 ビルス","description":"Драконий жемчуг: Супер — Бирус — проект, запущенный несколько лет назад, представляет собой обновлённую версию аниме Драконий жемчуг: Супер . Благодаря новейшим средствам визуализации каждая сцена, особенно батальные эпизоды, стала ещё более захватывающей, точнее и детальнее передавая оригинальное произведение Акир